00:01:50.229 --> 00:01:56.899
But Michael Steele believes that it's really
political opportunism and Trump being determined

00:01:56.899 --> 00:02:05.930
to retain control from a politically advantageous
perspective rather than simply sheer authoritarianism.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:10.279
But the main takeaway and the most important
point here is that both Charles Freed and

00:02:10.279 --> 00:02:14.689
Michael Steele believe that Donald Trump is
willing to do whatever he needs to do to remain

00:02:14.689 --> 00:02:16.270
in the White House.

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:20.129
And Trump has been signaling this by attacking
vote by mail.

00:02:20.129 --> 00:02:22.849
He's been saying he knows the election will
be rigged.

00:02:22.849 --> 00:02:26.519
It'll be the worst, the most rigged, most
fraudulent election in history.

00:02:26.519 --> 00:02:30.829
He's said this probably dozens, if not hundreds
of times at this point, and has been setting

00:02:30.829 --> 00:02:38.549
up a situation where he lays the groundwork
not to accept the results of the election.

00:02:38.549 --> 00:02:41.709
And then who knows what happens now.

00:02:41.709 --> 00:02:46.900
What we're seeing is that there are actually
Republicans getting together with progressive

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:54.510
organizations to develop a specific plan for
responding to Trump, rejecting the results

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.260
