00:03:18.689 --> 00:03:24.159
And these groups, which again, they now include
Republicans, these are not the left movement's

00:03:24.159 --> 00:03:27.439
uniquely Republicans are also concerned.

00:03:27.439 --> 00:03:31.370
They're also worried that Donald Trump will
