of absentee ballots, which, if fully counted,
could turn a small Trump margin on election

00:03:50.719 --> 00:03:53.409
night into a small Biden margin and hand a
hand.

00:03:53.409 --> 00:03:59.549
Joe Biden, the presidency, the The Indivisibility
