00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:09.359
specific plan to prevent the electoral process
from being undermined and subverted and disenfranchisement

00:04:09.359 --> 00:04:10.359
from running wild.

00:04:10.359 --> 00:04:16.000
Now, I still maintain that Donald Trump will
not succeed at maintaining power if he loses.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.180
I believe that he he will go if he loses.

