00:04:48.169 --> 00:04:52.970
I think those two scenarios are the ones that
will most likely weaponize, and that's literally

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:56.539
what it would be, his supporters with guns
to go out on the street.

00:04:56.539 --> 00:04:57.960
Now, there's another side to this.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.050
They are talk.

